Swoole with OpenSSL: the module swoole of php81-swoole built with the
OpenSSL of the base system (its SSL and TLS: SWOOLE_SSL, HTTPS, WSS),
with php81-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php81-mysqlnd. The same files as
php81-swoole: install one of the two.

PECL swoole for php81 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/swoole of the
release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20210902/swoole.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d.
